  "name": "MedDialog-Audio",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMedDialogue-Audio\n\t\n\nEnglish Medical Dialogue Corpus for Speech Recognition Research.\nThis repository contains MedDialogue-Audio, an English audio corpus designed for research in Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) in the healthcare domain.\nThe dataset was published in the proceedings of the 7th SBBD Dataset Showcase Workshop, and is available online at the following link: https://sol.sbc.org.br/index.php/dsw/article/view/37199\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nMedDialogue-Audio is\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Chandanmanvi/MedDialog-Audio.",
